I get up and go to my wardrobe.
I look at my mobile phone one more time.
The weather app says: It will rain today.
And it will be very cold.
I believe the app.
So today I need very warm clothes for the office.
I put on my new sweatshirt.
It is thick and grey.
Then I put on my coat.
It is heavy and dark green.
I also put on a hat.
My hat is yellow and very warm.
I look in the mirror.
I am well prepared.
I go to the door.
Next to the door stands my umbrella.
It is large and sturdy.
I take the umbrella and leave the flat.
